     : │ AggregateExec: mode=Final, gby=[], aggr=[numeric64_sum(numagg_0.price, 2) as agg_0, min(numagg_0.price) as agg_1, max(numagg_0.price) as agg_2]
     : │   CoalescePartitionsExec
